marvel studios just released a brand new  trailer for their upcoming series moon  night and it had a crazy scene included  where mark spector or moon knight is  absolutely beating the daylights out of  what appears to be a non-human character  so the question is who is this non-human  punching bag  welcome back to streaming the galaxy i'm  rocket riley and the new trailer for  moon knight probably gave everyone more  questions than answers but the biggest  question people seem to have is who is  moon knight absolutely thrashing in the  bathroom the series will follow mark  spector the fist of konshu which is a  deity worshiped by ancient egyptians as  the god of the moon in the comics and  seemingly in the trailer spectre has  dissociative identity disorder and  assumes a handful of different  identities to fight crime  this deity khonshu takes advantage of  mark's weakened mental state in order to  control him and make him the fist of  konshu it is in this possession of sorts  where mark specter becomes moon knight  and apparently knocks out monsters and  bathrooms upon first look i actually  thought he was beating up one of the  demogorgons from stranger things after  watching it in slow motion though i  noticed that the character seems to have  somewhat reptilian and dog-like features  so it's most likely the ancient egyptian  god anubis or one of his henchmen since  this series is expected to dive head  first into egyptian mythology it's only  natural that an egyptian deity such as  anubis might show up anubis is  recognized as the egyptian god of the  dead and he actually appeared in the  marvel comics at one point in the comic  mark spectre is killed and enters the  afterlife where he sees anubis while  it's not very likely that mark would be  able to beat up a god let alone on earth  in a bathroom he could be attacking  either a henchman of anubis or someone  else possessed by the spirit of anubis  similar to how mark is somewhat  possessed by the spirit of konshu we've  seen evidence of henchmen of anubis  fighting mark in the comics so i'm  thinking this is probably the most  likely of the two the only other  character this figure could be is  potentially jack russell otherwise known  as werewolf by night a character who was  frequently involved in the moon knight  comic storylines if werewolf by knight  does appear in the series he'll be  played by gail garcia bernal who has  been confirmed to play the character in  a halloween themed special on disney  plus later this year since he's already  confirmed to appear in an upcoming  marvel title it would only make sense  that werewolf by night might appear in  moon knight i'm not completely convinced  though that this figure is a werewolf i  think it's still most likely a henchman  of anubis because it's been rumored for  a while now that other ancient egyptian  deities would be showing up in the show  and anubis is one of the most well known  of them all regardless of who or what  this figure is i think we can all agree  that this series is going to take us in  a completely new and exciting direction  for the marvel cinematic universe  similar to how each of the marvel  television series have done previously  for more marvel television content check  out this video also don't forget to  subscribe like this video and thanks for  watching
 

